    "smooth_component_finite_volume_consequence": "A smooth rational plane component has degree 1 or 2. Kondo's finite-Aut classification therefore leaves only b=5, dimension 14, and Type VI in characteristic 3; this lane has at most one exact finite-volume isometry type, not a strict non-singleton class.",
